{"2725250":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Nientum - Op.ZERO","steam_appid":2725250,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Content Creation &amp; Streaming Guide<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content and stream &quot;Nientum - Op.ZERO&quot;. Individuals and companies alike can stream, make videos and monetize without asking us first.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original songs, including every story and chapter track, are not registered with Content ID, so monetizing is not a problem. Only four licensed songs in free song selection (PUPA, PUPA (Sakuzyo Latin Remix), Re：End of a Dream, 粉骨砕身カジノゥ) may receive a claim under their rights holders' policies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For any other inquiries, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:contact@queseragames.com\">contact@queseragames.com<\/a>.<\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;—To fade away... was it hope for you and me, or despair?&quot;<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Nientum – Op.Zero』<\/strong> is a 2D action-adventure music game that combines platformer, action, and adventure elements.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the stage through musical interactions and experience a unique journey to breathe life back into a theater that has settled in a gray stillness.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Strange Play Created Without Memories<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.poster.avif?t=1794543228\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.webm?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/f2e0e7e1ecdf7d2c52c9d10caadaee19.mp4?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A theater once filled with songs and stories is now filled only with silence.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate place, Aleph and Liora, who have lost their memories, become the Director and the Actress to raise the curtain on a new play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a stage that is beautiful yet foreboding, warm yet sorrowful, they discover lost clues one by one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What truth will they face in the final scene of this play? <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare the Stage Through Action — The Power of 'Tuning'<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.poster.avif?t=1794543228\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.webm?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.mp4?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gems scattered throughout the stages are fragments of broken notes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Aleph’s ability to tune them, play their restored notes, and restore stage devices to complete the preparations for the performance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As platforming, puzzles, and action naturally intertwine, the theater begins to regain its vitality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Performance Unfolds on the Stage You Tuned<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.poster.avif?t=1794543228\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.webm?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.mp4?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard of Oz, Cinderella, The Legend of King Arthur...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar tales are reinterpreted, and sometimes twisted, into musicals that unfold before your eyes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each of Liora’s successful performances, a fresh glow of life returns to the theater. And their journey continues to the next act.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truth Brought to Light — Endings Shaped by Your Choices<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.poster.avif?t=1794543228\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.webm?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/3841fb49fcc0822f25a75a6e595ac2a3.mp4?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Nightmares and hope, wishes and despair, new encounters and farewells.<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fragments of memory lost by Aleph and Liora are revealed one by one, following your choices.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the direction of your choices, the end of the story takes a completely different turn, drastically altering their fates.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please, join them in their journey and help raise the curtain on this strange play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Music and Voices that Bring the Stage to Life<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is filled with music composed by renowned artists such as<br><strong>Kagetora., Halv, and seatrus<\/strong>, delivering a deeply immersive experience.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main characters—including Aleph and Liora—are brought to life by talented voice actors such as<br><strong>Chika Anzai, Yuuki Takada, and Takehito Koyasu<\/strong>, vividly expressing the beauty and strangeness of the theater.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional Content<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Director's Room:<\/strong> A space where you can record and view the various collectibles gathered while completing the play.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Play Mode:<\/strong> A dedicated mode where you can enjoy tracks built with the rhythm-action expertise of Quesera Games, separate from the main story.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;—To fade away... was it hope for you and me, or despair?&quot;<\/i><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Nientum – Op.Zero』<\/strong> is a 2D action-adventure music game that combines platformer, action, and adventure elements.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune the stage through musical interactions and experience a unique journey to breathe life back into a theater that has settled in a gray stillness.<\/p><p class=\"bb_