/extras\/fa08426cbf562f5630cd0485af4686e7.mp4?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gems scattered throughout the stages are fragments of broken notes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Aleph’s ability to tune them, play their restored notes, and restore stage devices to complete the preparations for the performance.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As platforming, puzzles, and action naturally intertwine, the theater begins to regain its vitality.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Performance Unfolds on the Stage You Tuned<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.poster.avif?t=1794543228\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.webm?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/extras\/33c50a8c041d07569bbb4434198dac80.mp4?t=1794543228\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wizard of Oz, Cinderella, The Legend of King Arthur...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar tales are reinterpreted, and sometimes twisted, into musicals that unfold before your eyes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each of Liora’s successful performances, a fresh glow of life returns to the theater. And their journey continues to the next act.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Truth Brought to Light — Endings Shaped by Your Choices<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_ite