cated mode where you can enjoy tracks built with the rhythm-action expertise of Quesera Games, separate from the main story.<\/p>","short_description":"A 2D action-adventure rhythm game where the story unfolds by tuning the stage with music. A play by Aleph and Liora, who have lost their memories. A beautiful yet eerie stage, and the secret of the forgotten theater await. Your choices will determine the play's ending — and their fates.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","reviews":"“Perfect music in service of a perfect performance. Neither works without the other.”<br>9.2\/10 – 小黑盒 (Heybox)<br><br>“I had never played a rhythm game whose story and gameplay were woven together this closely.”<br>GameChosun (게임조선)<br><br>“Its multifaceted, truly theatrical charm, which goes beyond the bounds of a simple rhythm game, is what makes this game uniquely enjoyable.”<br>INDIE FREAKS<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/29049beddb4ece7370fc561f5fa8fedd9e133c6b\/header.jpg?t=1794543228","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/5d3cfcc2d00c057b1d888c3f69d0e41fae6c3be6\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1794543228","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2725250\/5d3cfcc2d00c057b1d888c3f69d0e41fae6c3be6\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1794543228","website":"https:\/\/www.queseragames.net","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-2120 | AMD FX-4350.<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTS 450 | AMD Radeon HD 5750.<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/